    "effectOrder": "BattleScript_EffectMinimize: attackcanceler, setminimize, setstatchanger STAT_EVASION +1, then BattleScript_EffectStatUpAfterAtkCanceler (attackstring, ppreduce, statbuffchange).",
    "maxEvasion": "setminimize executes before statbuffchange. At MAX_STAT_STAGE, ChangeStatBuffs selects B_MSG_STAT_WONT_INCREASE and STAT_CHANGE_ALLOW_PTR sets MOVE_RESULT_MISSED; Cmd_setminimize has no rollback, so its already-written bit remains until a later lifecycle clear.",
    "lifetime": "No source reader clears STATUS3_MINIMIZED alone. Battle initialization clears every gStatuses3 slot; ordinary switching and FaintClearSetData assign the active slot to zero. Baton Pass masks gStatuses3 to LEech Seed/Always Hits/Perish Song/Rooted/Mud Sport/Water Sport only, so it clears MINIMIZED while Cmd_switchindataupdate preserves the old statStages before that mask.",
    "stomp": "BattleScript_EffectStomp tests STATUS3_MINIMIZED on BS_TARGET; if present it writes sDMG_MULTIPLIER = 2 and then enters BattleScript_FlinchEffect. If absent it enters the same flinch route without that write."
